+//  (EastSun ruling R10 20260925: 「machinerecord.dat: NOT restored; tests must write a scratch copy instead;
+//  F5 (wb_serve) keeps golden behaviour」).  Same pattern as W906_UNLOADERINFO_ROOT above/below:
+//  W906_MACHINERECORD_DIR unset or empty => the golden literal is returned UNCHANGED, byte for byte, so
+//  production (wb_serve, F5) reads and writes d:\HT9045\system\ exactly as golden.  Set (tests/CMakeLists.txt
+//  does it for every ctest) => the same file name inside that directory.  Used by LoadMachineRecord's two
+//  ReadData pairs and SaveMachineRecord's WriteData pair, and for SaveMachineRecord's PickHPRec.json journal
