+//  Read-only env access; the directory must exist (WriteData does not create it; ctest's does).
+//  tests/test_mt_e3b_engine.cpp (ctest MT_E3b_Engine, PART A) asserts the variable is set, the redirect, and the
+//  machine files' unchanged size+stamp, so a failed redirect cannot look like a pass.
+//  NOT covered by this seam (not in the machinerecord path, reported): csystem.cpp DoCleanOutFinishCheck's
+//  PickFromHPList->ResetFile(sHPPickRec) -- inert today (csystem.cpp W7C1_TRecListSeam no-op stand-in), but the
